[36] The AGC has identified documents forming parts of exhibits included in Mr. Wu’s affidavit that were not before the Final Second Reviewer who rendered the Final Second Review Decision:
Exhibit “D” – Copy of a receipt from N. Wu dated January 1, 2020 in the amount of $125 (Applicant’s Record [AR] at 26);
Exhibit “L” – Copy of a letter dated May 22, 2024 from A. Lau (AR at 50);
